ion context; no suppression or downgrade change permitted.\\n\\n### Agent Instructions\\nNone identified.\\n\\n### Systems Inventory\\n1. Backlog MCP tool progress reporting -> FastMCP Context -> deprecated MCP logging capability.\\n2. MCP server tests -> in-memory FastMCP client -> warning collection.\\n3. Backlog migration CLI -> Typer option metadata -> CLI parser construction.\\n4. Migration fidelity CLI -> Typer option metadata -> CLI parser construction.\\n5. Migration CLI tests -> Typer runner -> repeated warning emission.\\n6. Git project-root timeout -> daemon worker thread -> queue handoff.\\n7. Hanging-path tests -> delayed synthetic exception -> pytest threadexception hook.\\n8. Dispatch tests -> later test activity long enough to collect escaped thread exceptions.\\n\\n### Ecosystem Completeness Checklist\\n- [ ] Every listed producer corrected or verified compatible\\n- [ ] Every affected consumer test updated\\n- [ ] No warning filters or dependency downgrades added\\n- [ ] CLI semantics retained\\n- [ ] Full bounded fast suite reports zero warnings\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Observed while validating #3778\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-09-21\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"6b2a61b597c82508d97051f7167fb27a3c52a098fa81d784474f16594f770bfb\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABVwg00g\"}"}